WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:09.025
Where a card lands in a tarot spread decides which question it
answers, so the same card can read differently each time.

00:00:10.325 --> 00:00:11.535
What a position is.

00:00:11.535 --> 00:00:14.082
A position is a named place in a spread.

00:00:14.082 --> 00:00:18.603
A three-card spread might have positions
called past, present and next.

00:00:19.903 --> 00:00:21.553
One card, three positions.

00:00:21.553 --> 00:00:26.185
Take the Three of Swords, a card showing a
heart pierced by three blades.

00:00:26.185 --> 00:00:29.168
Its general sense is sorrow or a painful
truth.

00:00:30.568 --> 00:00:32.888
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:32.888 --> 00:00:37.592
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
